      "username": "The_Girl_With_No_Nam",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-14T15:30:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, hey, they answered my question! Also, I’m not dead!</p>\n<p>Joke’s on Adam and Christopher, I’m now obligated to make a detective character&nbsp;from&nbsp;an alternate 1930s Rook City&nbsp;called F.L.A.T.S., or&nbsp;<strong>F</strong>inds and <strong>L</strong>ocates <b>A</b>ny <b>T</b>rail or <b>S</b>uspect, when I run my Sentinels RPG campaign.</p>\n<p>This was a good episode, but wow, they&nbsp;weren’t kidding about the format being different. I’ve missed so much... Can anyone who’s been keeping track of TLP point me to some, like, key episodes I should listen to from the past year? Just so I know the really important stuff&nbsp;that I missed, and I can start with those as I trawl through the backlog.</p>",
