      "id": 231269,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-14T16:18:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The Girl With No Name\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n The Girl With No Name:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can anyone who’s been keeping track of TLP point me to some, like, key episodes I should listen to from the past year? Just so I know the really important stuff that I missed, and I can start with those as I trawl through the backlog.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can always read <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Podcasts\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">WT’s handy notes</a> as delightfully advertised in the episode. :3</p>\n<p>But if you want to actually listen, most of the episodes of the past year are individual issues and so mostly dependent on how much interest you have in the story being featured. So general interest episodes would be anything labelled “[character] Supporting Cast” or “[character] Villains”, the D-List Heroes episode, and also the Day in the Life Bunker episode as it’s sort of a Bunker Supplemental and the recent “Writers’ Room: Disparation Vol. 2 Issue <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#21</span>” because it’s kind of like a general thing about Sentinels Manga.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
