      "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-14T22:28:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting note:&nbsp; Trollans are actually already a race in a major creative universe.</p>\n<p>Orko from Masters of the Universe features the planet Trolla, and calls its denizens Trollans.</p>",
