    {
      "id": 231277,
      "name": "FrivYeti",
      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-17T21:19:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also, bonus points to anyone that finds the major plot hole in this episode. (I posted it in the Spoiler Talk section of the Discord, so don’t look there if you want to play.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am guessing it is the fact that C&amp;A messed up how their time dilation was working.</p>\n<p>If time runs much faster on the planet, and Progeny crashed there weeks ago and moved on, that means that every minute outside is a much longer period on the planet, not the other way around. From KNYFE’s point of view, she could spend days or weeks on the planet helping to fix things without Progeny being able to get very far away out in space.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:30.432Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 4,
      "readers_count": 3,
      "score": 0.8,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 20039,
      "topic_slug": "episode-151-of-the-letters-page-writer-s-room-headhunter-3",
      "display_username": "FrivYeti",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"dpt\"]\n\nAlso, bonus points to anyone that finds the major plot hole in this episode. (I posted it in the Spoiler Talk section of the Discord, so don't look there if you want to play.)\n\n[/quote]\n\nI am guessing it is the fact that C&A messed up how their time dilation was working. \n\nIf time runs much faster on the planet, and Progeny crashed there weeks ago and moved on, that means that every minute outside is a much longer period on the planet, not the other way around. From KNYFE's point of view, she could spend days or weeks on the planet helping to fix things without Progeny being able to get very far away out in space.",
