      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I am guessing it is the fact that C&amp;A messed up how their time dilation was working.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yup! I’m looking forward to hearing their resolution. I hope it’s not just “the writers messed up”.</p>",
