      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/liarliar/{size}/1951_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-28T21:23:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I assume they just said&nbsp;it backwards. Obvs it’s more drama if just being on the planet means Knyfe is losing the trail, so hours on the planet = days outside it. And I don’t think that’s necessarily&nbsp;&nbsp;inconsistent with the story - there would just need to be something more at the start of the story that explains that she’s already lost the trail, and it’s getting colder.</p>\n<p>or, indeed, we have the old standard of Oops Turns Out Comic Writer Failed Science :P</p>",
